    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚙️ How to Setup\n\n1. Configure RSS feeds in the Workflow Configuration node - update the rssFeeds array with your preferred tech news sources\n2. Customize keywords in the Workflow Configuration node - modify the keywords and excludeKeywords arrays to match your interests\n3. Set up Slack integration:\n        * Create a Slack app and get an access token\n        * Add Slack credentials in n8n\n        * Update the slackChannel field in Workflow \n4. Adjust the timezone in the Schedule Trigger if needed\n\n## ℹ️ How to Use\n\nThe workflow runs automatically every day at 8 AM. It will:\n\n* Fetch articles from your configured RSS feeds\n* Filter them based on your keywords\n* Send a formatted digest to both Slack and Discord\n* Send a \"no articles found\" message if no matches exist\n\nYou can also trigger it manually by clicking the \"Test workflow\" button.",
        "height": 608,
        "width": 576,
        "color": 5
      },
